sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant S as Supervisor
    participant W as Worker
    participant R as Reviewer
    participant G as Gate
    U->>S: Goal + autonomy policy
    S->>S: Plan/DAG/Budget
    S->>W: Dispatch lane + brief
    loop execution
      W-->>S: heartbeat/progress
      alt context pressure
        S->>W: checkpoint/rotate
      end
    end
    W-->>S: result-ready + git evidence
    S->>R: independent review
    R-->>S: approve / changes
    alt changes
      S->>W: structured feedback
    else approve
      S->>G: combined gates
      G-->>S: pass/fail
    end
    alt human exception
      S->>U: one structured decision
      U->>S: resolve
    end
